{"id": "g-sum-verity", "question": "Summarize the plot of Verity.", "docs": ["verity"], "answer": "Struggling writer Lowen Ashleigh is hired by Jeremy Crawford to finish his injured wife Verity's bestselling series; living in their Vermont home she finds Verity's secret autobiography revealing dark acts toward her daughters, falls for Jeremy, and suspects Verity is faking her condition.", "key_points": ["Lowen Ashleigh is a struggling writer", "She is hired to finish the book series of bestselling author Verity Crawford, who was injured", "Jeremy Crawford, Verity's husband, brings her to their home in Vermont", "Lowen finds Verity's secret autobiographical manuscript", "The manuscript describes Verity's disturbing acts toward her twin daughters, Harper and Chastin, who both died", "Lowen and Jeremy become romantically involved", "Lowen comes to believe Verity is faking her incapacity", "A letter found at the end casts doubt on whether the manuscript was true"], "evidence": [{"doc": "verity", "quote": "finish the series, complete the book tours"}], "category": "global_summary", "expected_doc": "verity", "expected_scope": "global", "expected_aggregation": false, "difficulty": "hard", "split": "dev", "tags": ["hand_written"]}
{"id": "g-sum-ends", "question": "What is It Ends With Us about?", "docs": ["ends_with_us"], "answer": "Lily Bloom, from Plethora, Maine, moves to Boston, opens a flower shop and falls for neurosurgeon Ryle Kincaid; the marriage turns abusive, echoing her father's abuse of her mother, her first love Atlas Corrigan reappears, and she ultimately leaves Ryle to break the cycle for her daughter.", "key_points": ["Lily Bloom grew up in Plethora, Maine, where her father abused her mother", "She moves to Boston and opens a flower shop", "She falls in love with and marries neurosurgeon Ryle Kincaid", "Ryle becomes physically abusive", "Her first love Atlas Corrigan reappears in her life", "Her childhood diary entries are written as letters to Ellen DeGeneres", "She leaves Ryle to break the cycle of abuse for her daughter"], "evidence": [{"doc": "ends_with_us", "quote": "Adored mayor of my hometown of Plethora, Maine."}], "category": "global_summary", "expected_doc": "ends_with_us", "expected_scope": "global", "expected_aggregation": false, "difficulty": "hard", "split": "holdout", "tags": ["hand_written"]}
